{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01REKWDQkUKRbfgHQkiUr9Vw","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on the context filesystem, the new exception introduced as of 2026-04-01 is **`GroupCreationTimeUnknownException`**.\\\\n\\\\nThis exception signals when the group creation time is unknown in the Kafka KIP consumer offset-reset policy proposal (KIP-1282). \\\\n\\\\nAccording to the mailing list message from 黃竣陽 (Jiunn-Yang) on 2026-04-01, in response to Chia-Ping Tsai's inquiry about which exact exception should be thrown when the group creation time is unknown, the author states: \\\\\\\"I have introduced a new exception `GroupCreationTimeUnknownException` to signal this specific condition.\\\\\\\"\\\\n\\\\n**Source:** `/store/_intake/2026/04/01/mail-9f2cd16f7bbf9f088c40cada-a43ccce4.md` (line 31)\\\",\\\"error\\\":null,\\\"files\\\":[\\\"_intake/2026/04/01/mail-6f59f698d7605f0cccc53ab3-74eb2162.md\\\",\\\"_intake/2026/04/01/mail-9f2cd16f7bbf9f088c40cada-a43ccce4.md\\\"],\\\"seconds\\\":10.08,\\\"truncated\\\":false,\\\"turns\\\":2,\\\"usage\\\":{\\\"cache_read_tokens\\\":26335,\\\"cache_write_tokens\\\":5462,\\\"cost_usd\\\":0.0178085,\\\"input_tokens\\\":26,\\\"output_tokens\\\":845}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7f43c842-c792-412f-86ad-a3636b12e0db","uuid":"34fd76c6-dea3-415c-bf4e-02d2465733c5","timestamp":"2026-09-27T18:53:31.160Z","tool_use_result":{"content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"answer\\\":\\\"Based on the context filesystem, the new exception introduced as of 2026-04-01 is **`GroupCreationTimeUnknownException`**.\\\\n\\\\nThis exception signals when the group creation time is unknown in the Kafka KIP consumer offset-reset policy proposal (KIP-1282). \\\\n\\\\nAccording to the mailing list message from 黃竣陽 (Jiunn-Yang) on 2026-04-01, in response to Chia-Ping Tsai's inquiry about which exact exception should be thrown when the group creation time is unknown, the author states